{"title": "burst=5 不带 nodelay：排队匀速放行", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "# 串行连发 10 个，全部 200，看耗时："},
  {"t": "out", "s": "200 0.0008s 0.3309s 0.3367s 0.3255s 0.3264s"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "0.3201s 0.3276s 0.3397s 0.3266s 0.3259s"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "每个稳定多等约 0.33s（= 1/rate）"},
  {"t": "config", "s": "# 10 个同时到达："},
  {"t": "out", "s": "200 0.003s | 200 0.34s 0.67s 1.00s 1.34s 1.67s"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "503 x4（超出 burst 直接拒绝）"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "排队上限 = burst x 1/rate = 1.7s"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测：nginx:1.28-alpine 容器（nginx/1.28.3）"}
]}
